--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party front-end assets embedded in the binary
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The console serves its front-end from the binary itself: the files below
are compiled in with go:embed and are therefore redistributed with every
pgConsole binary and container image. Their licences and pinned checksums
live in third_party/, and the container image carries copies under
/licenses/pgconsole/third_party/.

htmx 2.0.10
  Zero-Clause BSD
  https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx
  See third_party/htmx/LICENSE

uPlot 1.6.32
  Copyright (c) 2022 Leon Sorokin
  MIT License
  https://github.com/leeoniya/uPlot
  See third_party/uplot/LICENSE

Alpine.js 3.15.12 (CSP build)
  Copyright (c) 2019 Caleb Porzio and contributors
  MIT License
  https://github.com/alpinejs/alpine
  See third_party/alpine/LICENSE

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Go dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Go module dependencies are linked into the binary rather than vendored in
this repository. Every release publishes an SPDX SBOM and a licence report
(licenses.csv) generated from the module graph; both are attached to the
GitHub release and the SBOM is also attested to the published image.
